      "content": "wait so you think it could be DVT? that sounds scary. but the breathing thing is mostly just a tightness in my chest, like i just can't get a full breath in. i'm sure it's just the pressure change or sitting too long. i dont really want to go to the er if i can help it, it seems overkill for just being tired. can i just take some ibuprofen and sleep it off? will that be enough to get the swelling down?",
